WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.500
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.500
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.670
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.670
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:50.580
POPP'S RESOLVE

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:56.550
What's happening to him?!

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.060
Baran's body...

00:01:58.060 --> 00:01:59.470
...Is changing!

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:13.690
Is this the true form of a Dragon Knight?!

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.950
Indeed.

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:18.990
The combined power of Dragon,
Darkling, and human.

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:22.450
The Ultimate Combat Form
of the Dragon Knight.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:24.580
That is this form.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:29.040
The form known as the Dragonoid!

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.370
The Dragonoid?!

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:35.340
Whoa! What unbelievable pressure!

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.550
No one's been this imposing before!

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.350
Not even Hadlar!

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:43.010
Popp, get into the castle!

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:46.060
No way! I'm fighting, too!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:50.190
Don't be stupid!
You can sense it, can't you?!

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.940
Baran's overwhelming Aura!

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:56.690
Besides, you're out of Magic Power!

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.700
You're useless here!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.450
Hey!

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:02.580
Popp! Don't be stubborn!

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:04.870
I'll support these two!

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.540
Look after Dai!

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:11.960
If anything happens to us,
take Dai and run as far as possible!

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.340
Dammit! Fine then!

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.090
Don't any of you die!

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.140
Look out!

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:31.820
Popp!

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:35.780
You dare attack the wounded
from behind?! How could you?!

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:38.320
Once I take Dragonoid form,

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:43.310
I become intent only on wiping out
any enemy in sight, like a Demon Beast.

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:49.240
This power is too strong
for me to hold back.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:54.920
Wounded or whelp,
I cannot spare any mercy.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.130
But can you blame me?!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:01.300
You pried into the scar on my heart.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.590
This is your own fault!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.560
Curse you!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.110
Crocodine!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.320
Woosh!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.200
D-Dammit!

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:35.620
He's going to wipe us out at this rate!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:44.560
We can't beat him!
Even if we were at our best!

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:47.930
His power is on a whole different level!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:53.770
He's truly a super being with the power
of a Dragon and Magic Power of a Darkling!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.850
You've seen nothing of my Magic Power yet!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:05.780
I'll erase you all in an instant...

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:10.580
with the purification spell
only usable in this form!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.120
With Doruora!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.960
W-We have to run!

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.050
It's no good! We can't move!

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:20.470
Stop, Baran! Don't give yourself
over to any more violence!

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:23.010
Your words mean nothing now.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:27.260
Once I take the form of the Dragonoid...

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:31.530
I cannot turn back until you are all dead!

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:33.060
Begone!

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.570
Dino!

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.120
Dai!

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.470
No!

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.230
What was that dream?

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:24.280
No, it was far more vivid than a dream.

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:25.570
A vision?!

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.700
Dai... Popp...

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:33.990
No!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.790
We can't let Dai and Baran meet!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:44.130
Dai, run! Get in the castle!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.710
Hey, Dai!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.600
Are you the one who called me?

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.440
I am.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:02.980
Who are you?

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:07.110
I am your father.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:13.540
But... you don't look like me at all.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.700
You look... like a monster.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:23.000
Indeed, this form is not human.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:27.010
It seems you take after your mother more.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:30.220
I doubt you can become a Dragonoid.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:31.300
But...

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.220
Remove that cloth.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:56.620
I can tell... I can tell!
You're not lying!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:08:03.380
That crest on your forehead is proof.
It's the unspoken bond between us.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:07.750
While our forms are different,
we are father and son.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.720
I am your father.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.970
My father...

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:25.900
Popp!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:35.780
Move!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:40.160
What can a piece of trash like you do?!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:44.880
Nothing! I know that already!

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:47.670
But I have to fight!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:52.300
I'm the only one left who can even stand!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:55.930
Don't, Popp! Don't challenge Baran!

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.220
That's right.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.680
I'll kill you!

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:06.150
If you attack me in this form,
I will brutally respond,

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:11.910
killing you and everyone here
except for Dino,

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:16.410
no matter how weak that attack may be.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:23.290
Meeting Dino has brought out my humanity,
but this is your last chance.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.910
Hand Dino over peacefully.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.010
You're in the way, mister.

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:31.130
Huh?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.300
I finally met my father.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.130
Dai...

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:38.760
What?

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:42.390
You can't have him! Father or not!

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:46.190
I'll never let you have our Dai!

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.030
"Our Dai"?

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:52.860
That's right!
Without Dai, Princess Leona would be dead!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:58.040
If they hadn't fought Dai, Crocodine
and Hyunckel would still be evil!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:01.490
And... And me...

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:06.540
If I hadn't met Dai,
I'd still be running away.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:10.590
I'd be a brown-noser.
All talk and useless!

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:13.720
There's no doubt I'd be worthless!

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:17.090
Meeting Dai changed all of our fates!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:21.760
It's thanks to Dai that we came this far!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:25.140
Dai is the one who lifts us up!

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:29.780
For Dai to become the enemy of humans...

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:33.020
For Dai to disappear from our lives...

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.030
I'd rather die than let that happen!

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.410
Then you shall die.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:53.970
It-It's no good!
He has no humanity left in him!

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.550
Dammit!

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.130
Popp!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:04.890
<i>What do I do? I've got no Magic Power
or powerful weapons or items!</i>

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.930
<i>All I can do is punch him!</i>

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:13.980
<i>Isn't there anything I can do?!
Think! Think!</i>

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:18.070
<i>If I don't act,
he's going to take Dai away!</i>

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:22.080
<i>Master... What would you do, Master Avan?</i>

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:25.540
<i>How would you fight
at a time like this, Master?</i>

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:26.990
<i>Master!</i>

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.290
<i>That's right...</i>

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.590
<i>There's still one thing I can do!</i>

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.550
CRACKLE
ICE-TYPE SPELL

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.600
FULLHEAL
HEAL-TYPE SPELL

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:46.850
<i>That's right...</i>

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:50.560
<i>There's still one thing I can do!</i>

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.810
<i>But if I do that...</i>

00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:59.490
Don't worry.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.200
I'll end this real quick.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.280
Huh?

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.240
Hold on to that bandana, will you?

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:12.000
I've had it since I was five.
It's my trademark.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.130
Me? Why?

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.290
Listen! Just don't lose it!

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.010
H-He's fighting bare-handed?!

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:25.680
Are you insane, Popp?!

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:29.520
<i>I can't watch
such a pathetic suicide attack.</i>

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.350
<i>I'll shatter him with one blow!</i>

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:39.020
Th-That's...!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.440
They won't come out!

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.490
His grip is just a weak Mage's!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.620
Obviously!

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:53.460
I've got all my life energy
focused in my fingertips!

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.580
I can't just let you pull them out!

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.630
You're not...!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.670
I knew it! That's...

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:01.300
Megante!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:05.760
If you use Megante, you're sure to die!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:10.600
I know! If I'm unlucky,
I'll be blown to pieces with nothing left!

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:13.060
Just like my master was!

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.980
Stop! This is crazy!

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:21.780
I idolized Master Avan, but this was
one trick I never hoped to copy!

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:24.660
You don't know if it'll work on Baran!

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:26.580
Oh it'll work.

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:29.160
The Draconic Aura may be a mighty shield,

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:33.250
but it can be pierced
by even greater energy!

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:36.630
That's what Baran said himself!

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:39.090
He's taken that much into account?

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:43.880
Plus, I get to die for Dai!
To die for the Hero!

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:48.300
Basically, I get to die
for the future of all humans!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.230
Who could ask for a better reason to die?!

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:54.650
Don't! Please, Popp!

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:57.100
Don't! Don't do it, Popp!

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.400
<i>This...</i>

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:06.360
<i>This has happened before!</i>

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:11.660
<i>I get the feeling...
Something really, really sad...</i>

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.040
<i>I have to... I have to do something!</i>

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.960
<i>I have to do something, but...!</i>

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.800
He's trying to rip his arm off!

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.760
Leona...

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.270
Hyunckel...

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.970
Crocodine...

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:37.520
Everyone...

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:40.690
I leave the rest to you.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:42.030
Popp!

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:44.820
Make something up for Maam, will you?

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:45.860
Popp!

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.200
Dai.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.380
Dai...

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:15.010
If you still have that dumb look
on your face when I die...

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.430
I'll be pissed!

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.240
See you, Dai.

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:25.360
We've gone through a lot...

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.320
It's been fun.

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:29.900
But...

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:42.620
<i>my adventure... ends here.</i>

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.220
Megante!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:16:00.810
Popp!

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.150
No!

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:14.410
Y-You idiot!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.990
I remember!

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:19.740
I remember it all, Popp!

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:22.250
Because I've been so pathetic...

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:23.620
you...

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.460
you...

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:30.390
Popp, I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:31.390
Dai!

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:36.230
Popp!

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:38.190
Has his memory returned?!

00:16:38.190 --> 00:16:42.890
But the price was all too high!

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.300
What?!

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:22.690
N-No! Even after Popp sacrificed himself!

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:26.610
Does even Megante have no effect on him?!

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:31.610
No. Even I would
take damage from Megante.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.860
But, his lack of experience saved me.

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:41.000
Just as he channeled all of
his life energy and detonated it,

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:45.080
he let his guard down, weakening his grip.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:50.300
I was able to fly up and shake him off.

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:52.340
Damn it all!

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.100
A meaningless death.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.810
C-Curse you!

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.640
Baran, why you...!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:07.940
Gomechan!

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.650
Gomechan, don't! Stop!

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:23.240
Begone!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:34.960
Enough!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:36.920
No more!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:40.680
Stop hurting my friends!

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:42.890
Dino...

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:47.230
It seems you really have
regained your memories.

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:51.240
I thought I completely erased them.
It's unbelievable.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:55.240
If you really are my dad,
why are you doing this?!

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:59.540
Why take my memories
and hurt and kill my friends?!

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:00.660
Silence!

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.910
I will wipe out the humans
and their allies!

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:06.910
If you are my son, you will obey me!

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.120
No!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:14.010
You're right that sometimes
humans can be cruel.

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:18.760
They can be selfish, they bully,
and they can discriminate.

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:22.970
But some of them aren't like that.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:29.310
They can be cowardly, but they
try their best to do what's right.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.650
That's...

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:35.820
That's who Popp was!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:43.410
He's doing it again!

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:51.750
There's no reason to remember such trash!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:56.090
I'll erase your memories again!
This time, completely!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.130
He's a monster!

00:19:57.130 --> 00:20:02.930
Now forget everything, Dino!
And become my true son!

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.940
<i>No! I...</i>

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:10.110
<i>I won't forget Popp ever again!</i>

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:12.900
<i>I'll never forget him!</i>

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.860
It's just like last time!

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:17.150
Can we do nothing?!

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:24.450
<i>Popp sacrificed himself and fought...</i>

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.870
<i>and I can't do anything!</i>

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:29.330
<i>Please, gods!</i>

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.460
God of Dragons! Lend us your strength!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:41.640
Don't resist!
Your whole mind could be wiped!

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:43.810
<i>I won't give in!</i>

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:45.590
<i>I'm me!</i>

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:48.560
<i>I'm Dai, the Hero!</i>

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:56.530
You still resist your father?! You fool!

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:58.270
You're not...

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.030
You're not...

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.610
You're not my dad!

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.670
<i>What?!</i>

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:17.960
<i>He struck me while I was shielded
by my Draconic Aura?!</i>

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:22.880
What?!

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:30.760
Dai's crest is on his fist?!

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:34.310
<i>What?! Impossible! This can't be!</i>

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:38.530
<i>In thousands of years
of Dragon Knight history</i>

00:21:38.530 --> 00:21:43.120
<i>for the light of the crest to appear
anywhere other than the forehead...</i>

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:45.650
<i>It's never happened before!</i>

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:47.740
<i>Could it be...?!</i>

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.460
<i>The human spirit?!</i>

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:54.250
<i>Is this Soala's will?!</i>

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.350
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.350
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:15.430
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:15.430
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.780
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.780
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:26.700
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:26.700
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:30.410
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:30.410
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.540
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.540
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:48.130
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:48.130
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:22:59.810
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:22:59.810
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.980
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.980
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:11.660
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:11.660
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:22.540
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:22.540
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:38.930
<i>With the Dragon Crest on his fist,
Dai unleashes his anger at Baran.</i>

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:44.230
<i>But Baran's flames of rage
are stoked by his son's retaliation.</i>

00:23:44.570 --> 00:23:47.690
<i>Teran Kingdom trembles
as the Dragon Knights clash.</i>

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:51.320
<i>The greatest battle in the world
begins now!</i>

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:54.160
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:54.330 --> 00:23:55.950
<i>"A Father and Son Clash"</i>

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:58.120
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
